@baseUrl = http://localhost:8081
@adminToken = paste-admin-or-operator-token-here


### 1. Actuator health
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health


### 2. Actuator metrics list
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/metrics


### 3. 查询订单创建计数指标
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/metrics/order.created.count


### 4. 查询本地消息 DEAD 存量指标
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/metrics/local.message.dead.count


### 5. 查询后台运维指标摘要，必须使用 ADMIN / OPERATOR token
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/ops/metrics-summary
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}


### 6. 查询演出列表，观察控制台接口耗时日志
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/shows


### 7. 查询演出详情，观察控制台接口耗时日志
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/shows/1


### 8. 提交异步下单，观察控制台接口耗时日志
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/async
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "showId": 1,
  "sessionId": 1,
  "ticketCategoryId": 2,
  "quantity": 1
}
